%% Phase1 / draft / MV3-G02e 草稿保存与恢复
%% 机器真源: phase1.manifest.json；MessageDialogService；Helix draft/mod.rs；SQLite draft projection
sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Angular chat input
  participant S as MessageDialogService
  participant T as Tauri bridge
  participant H as Helix Tick / draft domain
  participant DB as tenant SQLite draft
  UI->>S: saveDraft(channelId,text,mentions,replyMessage,documentSnapshot,documentUpdatedAt)
  S->>T: im_save_draft
  T->>H: Tick::Command(im_save_draft)
  H->>DB: Effect::Persist absolute draft state
  DB-->>H: Tick::PortReply(PersistOk)
  H-->>T: correlated Command Result
  Note over H,DB: persona-local；无 HTTP、WS 或业务 EventSink 事件
  UI->>S: restoreDraft(channelId)
  S->>T: im_query_draft
  T->>H: Tick::Command(im_query_draft)
  H->>DB: Effect::Persist ScopedGet(accountId,channelId)
  DB-->>H: PortReply(draft or null)
  H-->>T: correlated read result
  T-->>S: DraftProjection
  S-->>UI: signals restore text/@/reply/document
